		(property "Description" "QST QMA6100P 3-axis accelerometer, LGA-12 (2x2x0.95mm). I2C address 0x12/0x13 selected by AD0 (pin 1). SENB (pin 10) selects I2C vs SPI protocol - tie high/float for I2C. INT1 (pin 5) is the any-motion/no-motion hardware interrupt used for MCU wake. RESV1/RESV2 (pins 4/11) and NC (pin 7) per datasheet's I2C connection table (QST Doc #13-52-20 Rev A1)."
			(at 198.12 104.14 0)
			(hide yes)
